              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "anniekate3"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it, was fast and delish. Based on other reviews saying it was lacking flavor I sauted some green onions and mushrooms and artichoke hearts before adding gnocchi.",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-21T03:01:30.000Z"
