            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my favorite new recipe. There were just 2 of us and I used a 16oz pkg of DelLallo potato gnocchi and adjusted amounts. The only change was i used Romano as that is what I had. Even with 16 oz of gnocchi we had plenty of leftovers! I served with shake and bake chicken from this site and and a tossed green salad. Perfect!",
